{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally Comes Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Feeling Sick", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.</p> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.</p> For Past Continuous, we add <span class=\"strong\">was/were</span> + verb\u201c<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>\u201d to verbs.</p> You use Past Continuous verbs to describe a longer action that is interrupted by a shorter action.</p> You use Simple Past verbs to describe the shorter action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were eating\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"visit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"visited\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were visiting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"feel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"felt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were feeling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"catch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"caught\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were catching\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hurt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hurt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were hurting\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I had indigestion last night. My stomach hurt really badly! I ate at a weird falafel place when we were visiting the market.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Me too! I think we ate something bad while we were visiting the market.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Common Health Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are ill, you use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">I feel sick \u2026</span> or <span class=\"italic\">I have a/an \u2026</span> to describe the health problem.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These are some common health problems:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You ask <span class=\"italic\">Are you feeling okay?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">What's wrong?</span> if you want to know about someone's health problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Health Problem\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Stomach ache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your stomach\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Headache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your head\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Earache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain your ear\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sore throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A cold\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A common sickness caused by a virus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The flu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A serious sickness caused by a virus\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Toothache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your tooth\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Backache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cramp\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A sharp pain in a muscle\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: What's wrong, Bob?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I feel sick. I have a headache.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Does your stomach hurt?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Yes. I also have heartburn.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to catch a bug", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to fall sick with an unspecified illness", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think I caught a bug on the plane. My stomach hurts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you feel sick.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "immune", "type": "name"}, {"content": "resistant to a particular infection or illness", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Doctors are immune to many illnesses.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "falafel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a Middle Eastern dish of fried mashed chickpea balls", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I love eating falafel with pita bread.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "indigestion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pain in the stomach after you eat something bad", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I ate a bad falafel and now I have indigestion.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "inflamed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "red and swollen, often because of an infection", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My throat is inflamed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "heartburn", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a form of indigestion that feels like a burning sensation in the chest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I ate a bad falafel and now I have heartburn.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "flight attendant", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works on board a plane", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Flight attendants are immune to everything!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sweetie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a term of affection; sweetheart", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What's wrong, sweetie?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (10-12) about going to the doctor for a health problem you are experiencing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe the health problem. How do you feel? When did it start?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What could be the cause? What can you do about it?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to the doctor's advice and thank them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue (10-12 lines) about a health problem.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about what I was doing when the problem started and how I felt.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe a sickness and a cure for it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give advice.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Mum? I don't feel too good.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: What's wrong, sweetie?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure. My throat feels really swollen and inflamed. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Does your head hurt?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My head feels fine now, but my stomach doesn't. I also have heartburn. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Hmm ... What did you eat this morning? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I had my usual breakfast.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Maybe you just have a bit of indigestion.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No ... I think I ate something bad in Cairo.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Are you sure?", "time": "10600", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. I ate at a weird falafel place while we were visiting the market.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: That was a few days ago! Were you feeling sick when you took the plane?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I guess not ...</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: I bet you caught a bug from one of the passengers!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What about the flight attendants? They should be sick all the time!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Sweetie, I think they are immune to everything, including jet lag!", "time": "28800", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about common health problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can say what I was doing when something else happened.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Are you allergic to a certain kind of food?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What do you do when you feel sick? Call a doctor? Go to bed?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tri